<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    "OFFLINE", set under the symbol, in the offline build's launcher icon.

    Deliberately *not* defined in src/main: the two builds install side by side
    with the same symbol, so an unmarked icon is a wrong icon rather than a
    missing one. With no fallback in main, a flavour that fails to supply this
    fails to link, which is what LauncherIconTest pins.

    Letters are drawn as rectangles at 1.3 units thick, the same idiom as the
    keys above them, because a stroked outline at this size renders as a
    hairline on a low-density screen. Legible down to a 48px icon; below that
    the word is a shape rather than a label, which is all it needs to be.
-->
